refactor: admin UI overhaul before launch

Layout fixes
- settings page: below 960px the aside (budget meter + recent usage) is
  now a full-width block rendered AFTER the form instead of a 252px side
  column that starves the form, and no longer sits above it on phones
- recent-usage log collapsed into a <details>; long WeChat addresses get
  ellipsis with the full value on title hover; all usage/list text breaks
  anywhere so peer IDs can never stretch the page
- row titles word-break long addresses; small buttons reach 36px (44px on
  phones); overview issues card shows an alert pill when deliveries stall

Interaction fixes
- replaced every native confirm() with an inline two-tap confirm button
  (arm "确认删除?" for 3s, tap again to fire) - six destructive actions
- fixed a real rendering bug: unpinned memories appended a literal "null"
  text node (DOM append(null) coerces); now spread-conditional
- chat page shows a pulsing "正在输入……" line from send until an
  assistant bubble lands; cleared when history updates
- personas load before peer rows so binding selects are filled on first
  paint instead of only after the personas request happened to win the race

Verification
- scripts/check-api-pairs.mjs cross-checks every frontend call against
  server routes: all 37 calls matched; unused legacy endpoints listed
- 174 tests pass; scripts/push-upload2.mjs (argv-safe upload with stdin
  bodies and file-based commit messages) kept for future pushes
